{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51495","headline":"赠李商隐赠佳人 · 李郢","name":"赠李商隐赠佳人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金珠约臂近笄年，秋月嫦娥汉浦仙。\n云发腻垂香挅妥，黛眉愁入翠连娟。\n花庭避客鸣环佩，凤阁持杯泥管弦。\n闻道彩莺三十六，一双双映碧池莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}